node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
# TypeScript incremental build state. It lives OUTSIDE dist, so ignoring dist
# alone copied it in: with `incremental: true` in tsconfig.base.json, tsc read a
# local buildinfo claiming everything was already emitted, skipped emitting into
# the dist that .dockerignore had stripped, and the next package's build failed
# with "has no exported member". Found 2026-09-14 on the first uncached
# voice-runtime build; every earlier deploy had only passed on a cached layer.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.next
**/coverage
.git
.turbo
**/.turbo
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
